#### Load some pacakges   


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
library(tidyverse)
library(flextable)
library(ggpubr)
library(kableExtra)
```
:::


<br>

#### Load the mpg dataset   


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
data(iris)
```
:::


<br>

Every row in mpg is a car, every column a feature of that car. mpg stands for miles per gallon. 


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
head(iris)
```

