## Standard themes    

The default theme, featuring a gray background and white gridlines.

### theme_gray


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
plot <- ggplot(iris, aes(x = Sepal.Length, y = Sepal.Width, color = Species)) +
  geom_point()  

plot + theme_gray()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](3_ggplot_themes_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


<br>

### theme_bw  

A black on white theme.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
plot + theme_bw()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](3_ggplot_themes_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-5-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


<br>

### theme_linedraw

A theme with only black lines of various widths on white backgrounds.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
plot + theme_linedraw()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](3_ggplot_themes_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-6-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


<br>

### theme_light

A theme similar to theme_linedraw but with grey lines and axes designed to draw more attention to the data.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
plot + theme_light()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](3_ggplot_themes_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-7-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


<br>

### theme_dark

A theme similar to theme_light, but with a dark background. A useful theme for making thin colored lines stand out.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
plot + theme_dark()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](3_ggplot_themes_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-8-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


<br>

### theme_minimal

A theme with no background annotations.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
plot + theme_minimal()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](3_ggplot_themes_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-9-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


<br>

### theme_classic

A theme with no gridlines.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
plot + theme_classic()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](3_ggplot_themes_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-10-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


<br>

### theme_void

A completely empty theme.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
plot + theme_void()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](3_ggplot_themes_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-11-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


