```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](3_ggplot_themes_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-18-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


<br>

### theme_economist  

Theme inspired by The Economist.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
plot + theme_economist()
